  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  speakerName: Shana
  DialogText:
  - 'Skills have many aspects to them. '
  - 'Hover over a skill to see its information  '
  - 'In the far right box you will see the skills description. This includes what
    type of damage the skill deals,Physical, Magical or another, if that damage is
    elemental, if it applies any kind of conditions, and who it targets. '
  - 'In the middle box you will find a skills AP Cost in the top Left to the right
    of that you will find your Current AP(action points), and in the bottom left
    you will find the skills base power ( A damage multiplier to your attack stat). '
  - 'It costs AP to use skills and you start the battle with 1 AP and gain an additional
    1 at the start of your turn.  '
  - 'Skills also have something called Turn Shift.  The turn shift of a skill tells
    you how far forward or back a skill will take you in the turn order. '
  - 'To use a skill you will click it with the mouse and then select a target and
    press space. If the skill targets a whole side of the field or yourself you just
    have to press space.  '
  - Try using the skill Flame&Flood to skip enemies turn.
  textSpeed: 0
  endNodeEvent: []
  startNodeEvent: []
